 "title": "Closed image of the proper extension graph",
 "statement": "The morphism\n\n$$\n\\gamma_i=(\\psi_i,\\mathrm{incl})\\colon\nV_i\\longrightarrow U\\times_SX_i\n$$\n\nis proper. In particular, its image is closed.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-two-open/lemma-nagata-proper-extension-graph-closed.md",
